---
const SIGNUP_URL = 'https://app.axis-scale.com/register';
---
<section class="py-36 px-6 md:px-16 bg-base border-t border-[#1A2030]">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto">

    <h2 class="font-display font-[900] text-[44px] md:text-[50px] tracking-[-1.2px] leading-[1.08] text-pri max-w-[720px] mb-7" data-animate>
      Start now. Preparation is cheap vs. the deals you're gonna lose.
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sec text-[18px] leading-[1.65] mb-11 max-w-[560px]" data-animate>
      A customer already asking? You need the date to be soon: book the 4-week expert blitz. Nobody's asked yet? It's coming. Start while it's cheap.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-animate>
      <a
        href="#early-access"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-hover text-white font-semibold text-[15px] rounded-full transition-colors"
      >
        Get my audit date
      </a>
      <a
        href="#pricing"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 text-pri font-semibold text-[15px] border-[1.5px] border-[#2A3347] hover:border-pri rounded-full transition-colors"
      >
        Book your expert sign-off
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
